# Canonical author identities for `git shortlog`, `git log`, blame, and the
# GitHub contributors graph. This normalises display only; it does not and
# cannot rewrite commit history.
#
# Every maintainer commit — whether authored as "SackOfHacks" or the earlier
# typo "SockOfHacks", and whether it carries the plain e-mail or the GitHub
# noreply address — maps to the single account-linked identity below. Mapping
# by commit e-mail alone (the trailing `<...>`) collapses both name spellings.
